    {
      "id": "2123558605278609596",
      "text": "The process of moving Reid to a different role began a few weeks ago, lining. Howden was earning more snaps, Reid’s role was decreasing. The new direction was relayed to Reid, which led to the request. Now, he’ll have a chance to latch on with a new team.",
