      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1923044009964077057/Gd18eWkA_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "The #Saints have waived S Justin Reid, granting him his request to hit the wire/open market. He can be claimed for $577,777 the remainder of this season, plus a non-guaranteed $9.25M in 2027. New Orleans stands to take on dead cap hits of $5.2M this season, and $13.26M in 2027.",
      "quoted_author": "Spotrac",
      "quoted_handle": "spotrac"
    },
